# Git author

For this repository, every commit must be authored as:

`Joshua <dev.joshuadolor@gmail.com>`

- Prefer repo-local `user.name` / `user.email` (already set on this machine).
- If the environment may not use local git config, pass `--author="Joshua <dev.joshuadolor@gmail.com>"` on `git commit`.
- Push does not rewrite author; fix authorship on commits before pushing.
- Never modify global git config. Details: `docs/04-standards/git-conventions.md`.
